            <ArticleTitle>Rescue left main angioplasty on first post-operative day of coronary artery bypass graft surgery ischemia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>688-90</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Percutaneous revascularization has been used for the treatment of post-coronary bypass graft ischemia. This report illustrates the use of emergency left main coronary artery stenting in protected left main on the first post-operative day for management of perioperative coronary artery bypass graft surgery ischemia.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
